  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "mor_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -294
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Morph tunnel\n\nShape Morph blends a circle into a five-point star by `t`. A ForEach draws 22 of them, each smaller, turned a little more and at its own `t`, which rolls round with the loop: the shapes breathe from round to spiky and back.\n\nWire any two shapes into `a` and `b`: glyph outlines, a polygon, Cells.",
        "width": 470,
        "height": 230
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Morph tunnel\n\nShape Morph blends a circle into a five-point star by `t`. A ForEach draws 22 of them, each smaller, turned a little more and at its own `t`, which rolls round with the loop: the shapes breathe from round to spiky and back.\n\nWire any two shapes into `a` and `b`: glyph outlines, a polygon, Cells.",
        "width": 470,
        "height": 230
      }
    },
